  "description": "The STEVENS E-Inception ED 7.8.1 is designed for demanding rides and offers maximum freedom on any terrain – with powerful assistance, excellent control and a truly enjoyable ride. The powerful Bosch Performance Line CX motor with 120 Nm delivers confident propulsion on the steepest climbs, whilst the 800 Wh PowerTube battery provides the foundation for extended tours and long adventures. The bike really comes into its own on the descents: The RockShox suspension, featuring a 170 mm ZEB Select fork and Super Deluxe shock, smooths out even the most demanding trails and ensures controlled, safe handling. The newly developed aluminium frame combines modern design with progressive geometry, enabling a central, stable yet agile riding position. The mullet wheel combination of 29-inch at the front and 27.5-inch at the rear combines excellent roll-over performance with lively, agile handling. An e-enduro that impresses with performance, control and versatility – built for intense trail experiences on any terrain.",
